message: "If you use Kettu-Shortmaster in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Kettu-Shortmaster"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kettunen
    given-names: Aurum
    alias: Veikkokettu
repository-code: "https://github.com/neuratechcompany-ops/Kettu-Shortmaster"
url: "https://github.com/neuratechcompany-ops/Kettu-Shortmaster"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code / Codex skill that turns any topic into a narrated motion-graphics
  explainer video in Chinese or English. Black starfield canvas, white line art with
  purple accents, TTS voiceover, word-aligned subtitles and a chapter progress bar;
  every frame is drawn in code with Remotion (React + TypeScript). Ships a compilable
  template, primitives and lighting library, voiceover / storyboard / render / QC
  tooling, written style and motion specs, a multi-agent build protocol and a complete
  reference film as the quality bar.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - codex
